<title>HONG KONG: CitiBank chosen HK Telecom ADR depositary.</title>
<headline>CitiBank chosen HK Telecom ADR depositary.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>CitiBank said on Wednesday it had been chosen as the Successor Depositary Bank for Hongkong Telecom's New York Stock Exchange-listed American Depositary Recipt (ADR) programme.</p>
<p>After the transfer of the ADR programme to CitiBank, Hongkong Telecom, a subsidiary of Cable &amp; Wireless Plc, would continue to be traded on the New York Stock Exchange, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Each ADR is equivalent to 10 ordinary shares of the company and would trade under the symbol of HKT, CitiBank said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
